格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Custom wallpapers and translucent skins for DeepSeek Harness Web","id":"gh:1344799417","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-custom-skin","slug":"SLin-code/dsh-custom-skin","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Custom wallpapers and translucent skins for DeepSeek Harness Web"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-custom-skin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Custom wallpapers and translucent skins for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Upload or drag in multiple local images and switch between them instantly.\n- Choose Chinese or Eng"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"lish from the plugin page; the selection updates all of DSH Web and uses DSH's saved language prefer"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ence.\n- Show or hide the wallpaper, delete individual images, or clear the entire library.\n- Adjust "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"image fit, position, overlay, blur, and panel opacity.\n- Automatically adapt to the light and dark t"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"hemes in DSH.\n- Keep images in the current browser's IndexedDB and preferences in localStorage. Noth"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ing is uploaded to the DSH server."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install in DSH Web"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Run the following commands in the DeepSeek Harness repository:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Open **Settings** in the lower-left corner of the Web interface, then select **Personalization** to "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"add a wallpaper or switch the interface between **English** and **Chinese**."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"To install a local development copy instead:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"To uninstall:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Build from source"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js 22.19 or later and pnpm 11.7.0."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The repository includes the compiled `lib/` files, so a regular local installation does not require "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"tory includes the compiled `lib/` files, so a regular local installation does not require a rebuild."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Data and limitations"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- Each image can be up to 20 MB, with a maximum of 24 saved images. The browser's storage quota may "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"impose a lower practical limit.\n- Wallpapers are isolated by browser and site origin. If you open DS"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"H in another browser, on another port, or at a remote address, you will need to add the images again"},{"id":"p21s4","text":".\n- Clearing the site's browser data also removes the saved wallpapers."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
